1
00:00:13,934 --> 00:00:19,426
The wooden clock is hammer-striking time

2
00:00:20,173 --> 00:00:25,402
My father’s shadow looming on the wall

3
00:00:26,919 --> 00:00:31,325
"No more dancing," screams his bitter crime

4
00:00:31,546 --> 00:00:38,065
I fold my hands and watch my kingdom fall

5
00:00:39,671 --> 00:00:45,152
And every night I run, barefoot on the stone

6
00:00:46,131 --> 00:00:51,683
Screaming your name, but my throat is made of glass

7
00:00:52,355 --> 00:00:57,394
Through endless alleys, terrified and alone

8
00:00:57,441 --> 00:01:07,794
Chasing the shadow of a time that had to pass

9
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:20,651
A future paved in ledgers, cold and dry

10
00:01:21,857 --> 00:01:26,466
While deep inside, the silent lion starts to cry

11
00:01:28,166 --> 00:01:32,429
But you are gone, dissolved into the air

12
00:01:32,679 --> 00:01:38,805
No phone to call, no door where I can knock

13
00:01:40,897 --> 00:01:46,473
I draw your silent code upon my skin

14
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:53,186
Locked in a nightmare that I can never win

15
00:01:53,699 --> 00:01:58,475
The streetlights bleed a sickly yellow stain

16
00:01:58,621 --> 00:02:08,914
Under a sky that’s heavy with the storm

17
00:02:21,909 --> 00:02:27,390
Just empty space and phantom scent of hair

18
00:02:28,035 --> 00:02:33,826
And the ticking of a loud, merciless clock

19
00:02:34,685 --> 00:02:39,999
How do I find you when the world goes cold?

20
00:02:41,270 --> 00:02:50,261
With all the words of love I left untold

21
00:02:51,241 --> 00:02:56,566
My feet are bleeding in the humid rain

22
00:02:57,401 --> 00:03:03,287
My shivering body desperly seeking warm

23
00:03:03,825 --> 00:03:08,625
But every house has closed its curtains tight

24
00:03:08,672 --> 00:03:19,204
No friendly face to guide me through the night

25
00:03:31,090 --> 00:03:34,386
And then a flash of red, a sudden spark

26
00:03:34,451 --> 00:03:37,544
The way your rumba dress would wave and spin

27
00:03:37,628 --> 00:03:40,780
I throw my breaking body through the dark

28
00:03:40,959 --> 00:03:44,111
Almost touching the soft warmth of your skin

29
00:03:44,816 --> 00:03:49,337
But as I reach, the street begins to stretch

30
00:03:49,578 --> 00:03:55,501
A cruel mirage my aching mind would sketch

31
00:03:57,293 --> 00:04:01,926
I wake up shivering, drowning in my sweat

32
00:04:02,143 --> 00:04:12,794
The orange streetlight cutting through the blind

33
00:04:24,952 --> 00:04:29,394
My heavy sheets are clammy, cold, and wet

34
00:04:30,815 --> 00:04:36,522
While the study ledger haunts my mind

35
00:04:37,504 --> 00:04:42,495
The dance school was my oxygen, my breath

36
00:04:44,072 --> 00:04:53,183
Now this quiet room feels like a living death

37
00:04:53,666 --> 00:04:59,051
I choke my sobs into the pillowcase

38
00:05:00,147 --> 00:05:05,401
Because I let you go without a fight

39
00:05:06,170 --> 00:05:10,886
No one can see the tears upon my face

40
00:05:10,896 --> 00:05:21,750
No one can hear the terror of the night

